---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import InfoNote from '../components/InfoNote.astro';
import TopicCard from '../components/TopicCard.astro';
import { topics } from '../data/topics';
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Independent sex education</p>
      <h1>把复杂的性健康知识，<em>讲清楚</em>。</h1>
      <p class="lede">一个独立编写的中文科普站，聊聊同意、避孕、检测和身体常识。我们相信，好的信息应该让人更安心，而不是更焦虑。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="#topics">从基础话题开始</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/about/">了解本站</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="topics">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Start here</p>
          <h2>先从最常见的问题开始</h2>
        </div>
        <p>每篇文章都尽量使用清楚的语言，并在文末列出参考来源。健康情况因人而异，必要时请咨询专业人员。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="topics-grid">
        {topics.map((topic) => <TopicCard topic={topic} />)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">How we write</p>
          <h2>我们怎样整理内容</h2>
        </div>
        <p>科普不是口号，更不是诊断书。我们把证据、边界和不确定性一起写出来。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principles">
        <div class="principle">
          <span class="principle-number">01 / CLEAR</span>
          <h3>先说人话</h3>
          <p>尽量解释术语背后的原因，而不是堆叠名词。读完之后，你应该知道下一步可以问什么。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principle">
          <span class="principle-number">02 / HONEST</span>
          <h3>承认不确定</h3>
          <p>人体没有标准答案，方法也有适用边界。我们不会把个别经验包装成适用于所有人的规则。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="principle">
          <span class="principle-number">03 / KIND</span>
          <h3>不制造羞耻</h3>
          <p>好奇、犹豫和提问都很正常。站点不评判读者，也不把健康问题变成道德评价。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <InfoNote label="阅读前请记住">
        <p>这里的内容用于一般科普，不能替代面对面问诊、检验或治疗。如果出现急性疼痛、异常出血、发热、持续不适或可能暴露于感染风险，请及时联系当地医疗机构。</p>
      </InfoNote>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
